  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 19970932736
    m_Localized: Shop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19987709952
    m_Localized: Oh, my favorite customer! Come see everything I have to offer you,
      Jolli-Jelli!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19987709954
    m_Localized: Yanyapon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19991904256
    m_Localized: The thrill of chance! Will you find THE ultimate sticker? Or 10
      of the same old one...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19991904259
    m_Localized: If luck isn't on your side, this is the perfect way to expand your
      collection!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19991904261
    m_Localized: Give the borders surrounding our world a little polish!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19991904263
    m_Localized: Are some the achievements giving you a hard time? Just wish for
      them to be beaten!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19991904265
    m_Localized: A good mood is priceless!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19991904268
    m_Localized: Take care, Chuchu!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19991904269
    m_Localized: Talk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19991904270
    m_Localized: Yanya introduced me to one of those electronic poker games, but
      the rules are completely different!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19987709953
    m_Localized: Buy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19991904258
    m_Localized: Single Sticker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19991904260
    m_Localized: Overlay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19991904262
    m_Localized: Wish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19991904264
    m_Localized: Little Smile
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19991904267
    m_Localized: Sorry Chuchu, I can't give credits. Come back when you're a little
      hmmm... richer!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19991904257
    m_Localized: "D\xF4 no Gelato is not responsible for your bad luck"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19991904266
    m_Localized: It's a pleasure doing business with you, honhonhon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19991904271
    m_Localized: Chuchu, Merry's been staring at me for ten minutes. I'm totally
      freaked out. Help! This woman is a threat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19991904272
    m_Localized: Someday I'll have to teach you a few fighting techniques. I used
      to be a champion, you know?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19991904273
    m_Localized: This coffee is all for me! It's a promise I kept for her... I hope
      she's doing well...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19991904274
    m_Localized: Yanya can't help but adopt every stray cat she finds, but hey, at
      least it brings in customers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19991904275
    m_Localized: I'M IN DEBT, CHUCHU! So at least buy me something! Just a little
      something, just a little!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29411606544384
    m_Localized: And here's a free smile for you! So, are you actually going to buy
      something now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
